OL,3,AHusband of attacked Australian MP to
OL,4,Aspeak after suspect faces court for
OL,5,Afirst time
OL,6,
OL,7,FPhil Haines, husband of MP Helen
OL,8,FHaines, is to give an update on her
OL,9,Fhealth shortly
OL,11,FHaines suffered severe lower body
OL,12,Finjuries on Monday when she was hit by
OL,13,Fa car, and local media have reported
OL,14,Fone of her legs has been amputated
OL,16,FThe man charged over the alleged
OL,17,Fattack, Brendan Nugent, has briefly
OL,18,Ffaced court. Our correspondent Katy
OL,19,FWatson was in the courtroom
OL,21,FNugent, 43, did not apply for bail. He
OL,22,Fis due to return to court in February
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
