OL,3,AHusband of attacked Australian MP to
OL,4,Aspeak after suspect faces court for
OL,5,Afirst time
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe has been charged with dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving causing serious injury,
OL,9,Fintentionally causing serious injury,
OL,10,Fand causing harm to a Commonwealth
OL,11,Fpublic official
OL,13,FPolice have not ruled out additional
OL,14,Fcharges, including attempted murder
OL,16,FThey say the motive for the alleged
OL,17,Fattack is still unclear and they had no
OL,18,Fprevious indication that Nugent could
OL,19,Fhave carried out something this
OL,20,F"atrocious"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
